Rāma asks Lakṣmaṇa to choose āśrama near water --- Lakṣmaṇa defers choice to Rāma --- Rāma chooses level flowering site by Gōdāvarī --- Rāma praises lotus pond hills trees and game --- Lakṣmaṇa builds spacious leaf hut quickly --- Lakṣmaṇa bathes and brings lotuses and fruits --- Lakṣmaṇa worships and shows finished āśrama --- Rāma rejoices embraces Lakṣmaṇa and dwells happily